### vision-defectos-tela API: example requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
# Set the variables below. Never commit a real key.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = {{$dotenv DEMO_API_KEY}}

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Inspect an image (multipart). Optional: roll_code + position_m
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/predictions?include_heatmap=false
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hole.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../demo/samples/hole.jpg
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="roll_code"

RL-2026-0001
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="position_m"

12.5
--boundary--

### Latest predictions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/predictions?limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Rolls and their four-point grade
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Roll detail + textrack payload
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls/RL-2026-0006/quality
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Grade now and store an alert if needed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls/RL-2026-0006/assessments
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ISO 2859-1 plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quality/aql-plan?lot_size=500&aql=2.5&inspection_level=II
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Lot acceptance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lots/LT-2026-02/inspections
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"aql": "2.5", "inspection_level": "II"}

### Drift of the last 200 predictions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitoring/drift?window=200
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Savings estimate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/savings/estimate
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"meters_per_month": 50000, "manual_recall": 0.7}

### Served models (model card)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/models/current
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
